times, div, mod, plus, minus, to-int, to-str, round-to-nth, prettyp-num-en.
Hash sums use two terms here so the order cannot change the result.
-- t01.hbs --
{{times a b}}
-- t02.hbs --
{{times a 2}}
-- t03.hbs --
{{times a 1.5}}
-- t04.hbs --
{{times "2" b}}
-- t05.hbs --
{{div a b}}
-- t06.hbs --
{{div a 0}}
-- t07.hbs --
{{div 0 0}}
-- t08.hbs --
{{div a 3}}
-- t09.hbs --
{{mod a b}}
-- t10.hbs --
{{mod a 2}}
-- t11.hbs --
{{mod a 0}}
-- t12.hbs --
{{mod "x" "y"}}
-- t13.hbs --
{{mod a "y"}}
-- t14.hbs --
{{plus x=a}}
-- t15.hbs --
{{plus x=a y=b}}
-- t16.hbs --
{{plus x=a y=1}}
-- t17.hbs --
{{plus}}
-- t18.hbs --
{{plus a}}
-- t19.hbs --
{{minus a}}
-- t20.hbs --
{{minus a x=b}}
-- t21.hbs --
{{minus a x=1.5}}
-- t22.hbs --
{{minus "10" x=a}}
